          "A <strong>circular array</strong> means the end of the array connects to the beginning of the array. Formally, the next element of <code>nums[i]</code> is <code>nums[(i + 1) % n]</code> and the previous element of <code>nums[i]</code> is <code>nums[(i - 1 + n) % n]</code>.",
